<Project>

  <!--
    Intentionally empty, and it stops MSBuild's walk up to the repository root — the same
    device scripts/generate-scale-project.py uses, for the same reason.

    The repository's Directory.Build.props turns warnings into errors, enables the trim
    and AOT analysers and forces documentation comments. None of that belongs on a
    measurement host, and more importantly: a change to the repository's build settings
    must not be able to change what this probe reports. The number is committed as a
    baseline and compared against later runs, so anything that can move it silently is a
    defect in the harness.
  -->

</Project>
